    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_author">by Infrared</string>
    <string name="about_dedicatory">Created with love for my son. Now available for all. Free, no ads!</string>
    <string name="about_descrition">A fun, simple, and addictive game for all ages. I hope you enjoy it as much as I do.</string>
    <string name="about_credits">Special thanks for the excellent assets provided by:</string>
    <string name="about_close_button">Close</string>
    <string name="about_tutorial_title">How to Play</string>
    <string name="about_tutorial_descrition">The goal is simple: clear all the tiles from the board without letting the bar at the bottom fill up!</string>
    <string name="about_tutorial_point1">1. Tap a tile to move it to the bar below.</string>
    <string name="about_tutorial_point2">2. Collect 3 identical tiles in the bar to make them disappear.</string>
    <string name="about_tutorial_point3">3. Be careful! If the bar fills up, the game is over.</string>
    <string name="about_tutorial_point4">4. Clear all the tiles from the board to win!</string>
    <string name="about_tutorial_help_title">Help &amp; Power-ups</string>
    <string name="about_tutorial_help_descrition">Feeling stuck? Use one of these power-ups to help you out!</string>
    <string name="about_tutorial_help_point1">• Extra Space: Grants you one extra temporary slot in the bar.</string>
    <string name="about_tutorial_help_point2">• Shuffle Board: Mixes up all the remaining tiles on the board.</string>
    <string name="about_tutorial_help_point3">• Reveal Board: Temporarily reveals all hidden tiles for 10 seconds.</string>

