    <string name="game_tutorialdialog_title">How to Play</string>
    <string name="game_tutorialdialog_point1">Match three tiles of the same kind to clear them.</string>
    <string name="game_tutorialdialog_point2">Just tap a tile to send it to the bar at the bottom. The bar can only hold a limited number of tiles, so plan your moves carefully!</string>
    <string name="game_tutorialdialog_point3">Some tiles are on top of others. To free them, you must first remove the tiles that are blocking their way below.</string>
    <string name="game_tutorialdialog_point4">Need a hand? You can get some special help:</string>
    <string name="game_tutorialdialog_point4a">• Extra Space: Adds one more slot to your bar.</string>
    <string name="game_tutorialdialog_point4b">• Shuffle Board: Rearranges all the tiles left on the board.</string>
    <string name="game_tutorialdialog_point4c">• Reveal Board: Briefly shows all the hidden tiles for 10 seconds.</string>
    <string name="game_tutorialdialog_point5">Have fun!</string>
    <string name="game_tutorialdialog_close_button">Got it!</string>
    <string name="game_tutorialdialog_point6">Walls: The grey blocks are walls. You cannot move them, and they take up space on your board. Walls block the path to the tiles above.</string>
    <string name="game_tutorialdialog_point7">Hidden Blocks: These blocks are not yet clickable because there is no path from the bottom to them. To reveal these tiles, you must remove the blocks around them.</string>
